---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { LAB1, googleCalendarUrl } from '../../lib/lab-schedule';

const gcalUrl = googleCalendarUrl(LAB1);
---
<Base
  title="You're In — Leadership Labs | Greg Weinger"
  description="You're registered for the next Leadership Lab. Check your inbox for confirmation."
  minimalHeader
>
  <meta slot="head" name="robots" content="noindex" />
  <div class="container">
    <h1>You're in.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Check your inbox — your confirmation is on the way, and your invitation to the next Lab will follow.</p>

    <div class="labs-next-card">
      <p class="labs-next-card-label">Save the date · {LAB1.title}</p>
      <p class="labs-next-card-date">{LAB1.dateLabel} · {LAB1.timeLabel}</p>
      <div class="labs-add-to-cal">
        <a class="btn-secondary" href={gcalUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Add to Google Calendar</a>
        <a class="btn-secondary" href={LAB1.icsUrl} download>Download .ics (Outlook / Apple)</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p>In the meantime: if you haven't watched the masterclass yet, start there — <em>Why Everything You've Been Told About Getting Ahead as an Introvert Is Wrong.</em> <a href="/masterclass">Watch it free →</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
